abstract: >-
  A self-contained 23-chapter guide covering the complete pipeline from
  molecular electronic structure to quantum circuit compilation. Includes
  six fermionic encodings (including Vlasov tree), qubit tapering, Trotter decomposition, circuit
  export, and computed results (H₂ dissociation curve, H₂O bond angle scan).
  Companion labs provide interactive F# scripts using the FockMap library.
